SRD catalogue sprites
=====================

Copyright B4mad Technologies and Spellkave contributors.

These images are licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0
International License (CC BY 4.0):
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode

Suggested credit: "Spellkave art, CC BY 4.0".

Spellkave sprites for SRD catalogue entries: creatures, items, spells, feats, species, backgrounds, skills, divine orders and character portraits. The 387 magic item variants are composites of a base sprite and a badge from `../../art/badge/`. They are original Spellkave material, generated with PixelLab
(https://www.pixellab.ai). The `.json` sidecar next to each image records
the generator, prompt, time and SHA-256 of the image bytes.

The SRD 5.2.1 names and rules text these images illustrate stay under their
own CC BY 4.0 grant and credit (see the repository NOTICE.md). The images are
not Wizards of the Coast material and do not imply endorsement.
